   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><b><font size=\"4\">Hi, Dr. Yu</font></b><div><div><font size=\"4\"><b>I am a fresh follower of ggtree since 2 weeks ago. GgTree is such a powerful and flexible tool to explore the phylogenetic trees.</b></font></div><div><font size=\"4\"><b>My goal is to explore the reassortment between the different segments of the influenza virus. The incongruence tree is one of the apparent ways to show potential reassortment between the different segments. Just like this picture.</b></font></div></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><font size=\"4\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/bioc-ggtree/attach/7d3f8e1aba07a/Image.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Image.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" title=\"\"></font></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><div><font size=\"4\"><b><br></b></font></div><div><div><font size=\"4\"><b>So far, I already linked the tree. But I was struggled with how to set the line color which can vary with the tips information (which is Host here). </b></font></div><div><font size=\"4\"><b>As I said, I am a new learner of ggtree and even the R. Lots of things waiting for me to learn. I was trying to set the geom_line and failed to achieve that.</b></font></div><div><font size=\"4\"><b><br></b></font></div><div><font size=\"4\"><b>So, could you please help me figure this last step?</b></font></div><div><font size=\"4\"><b>Thanks a lot</b></font></div></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/bioc-ggtree/attach/7d3f8e1aba07a/tangle%20tree.png?part=0.2&amp;view=1\" alt=\"tangle tree.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" title=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\">Here is the meta data</p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/bioc-ggtree/attach/7d3f8e1aba07a/meta%20data.png?part=0.3&amp;view=1\" alt=\"meta data.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" title=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;./H7N9_HA.newick&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br> <br><br>y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;./H7N9_NA.newick&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>p1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ggtree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>p2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ggtree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>  <br><br>d1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> p1$data <br><br>d2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> p2$data <br><br>  <br><br>tip_metadata </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">table</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;meta_data.txt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;\\t&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> header</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">check</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">names</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stringsAsFactor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">F</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>  <br><br>d2$x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d2$x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> d2$x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d1$x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>  <br><br>pp </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> p1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> geom_tree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>  <br><br>dd </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bind_rows</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> d2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>  filter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(!</span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">na</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>  <br><br>pp </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> pp </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&lt;+%</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tip_metadata </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>  geom_tippoint</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Host</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>  scale_color_manual</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">values</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;cyan&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;green&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;red&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;blue&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;lightcyan&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;springgreen&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;pink&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;grey&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;royalblue&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;black&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>  geom_line</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;red&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> alpha </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>  theme</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">legend</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">position</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;right&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>pp</span></div></code></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><br><u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p></div><div><font size=\"4\"><b><br></b></font></div><div><font size=\"4\"><b><br></b></font></div><div><font size=\"4\"><b><br></b></font></div></div>"
