     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">how can you expect the command:</p></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important\"> geom_line(aes(x, y, group=label), data=dd, color=&#39;red&#39;, alpha = .1)\r\n</code></pre></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">would color the lines?</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">You just set them all to <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">red</code>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">If you really follow examples on <a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter2.html#ggtree-fortify\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter2.html%23ggtree-fortify&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482183701000&amp;usg=AOvVaw34oIixNVbvvHgeHTkhoBLq\">https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter2.html#ggtree-fortify</a>, you should know how to do it by providing a variable (host in your case) in the <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">dd</code> and mapping color by <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">aes</code> to the variable.</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdj48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj5ob3cgY2FuIHlvdSBleHBlY3QgdGhlIGNvbW1hbmQ6PC9kaXY+\r\nPGRpdj48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj5gYGA8YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj4KPGNvZGU+PHNwYW4gc3R5bGU9\r\nImNvbG9yOiByZ2IoMCwgMCwgMCk7Ij5nZW9tX2xpbmU8L3NwYW4+PHNwYW4gc3R5bGU9ImNvbG9y\r\nOiByZ2IoMTAyLCAxMDIsIDApOyI+KDwvc3Bhbj48c3BhbiBzdHlsZT0iY29sb3I6IHJnYigwLCAw\r\nLCAwKTsiPmFlczwvc3Bhbj48c3BhbiBzdHlsZT0iY29sb3I6IHJnYigxMDIsIDEwMiwgMCk7Ij4o\r\nPC9zcGFuPjxzcGFuIHN0eWxlPSJjb2x